A||||35||FOCONE||And the winners are.....||||14||
Z||000000||FOCONE||06-17-2001||09:35 PM||||And the winners are.....<P><BR>1984 1st 	Mark Webber<P>1985 1st 	Mark Webber<P>1986 1st 	Jody Lemos<BR>     2nd	Tim Perrigo<P>1987 1st	Bob Umberger<BR>     2nd	Richard Leblanc<BR>     3rd	Brian Manke<P>1988 1st	William Wisocki<BR>     2nd	Robert Kittell<BR>     3rd	Ray Becker<BR>     4th	Les Sandy<P>Modified Class<P>         6th	Rich Gagne<BR>         5th 	Chris Schafer<BR>         4th	Joe Becker<BR>         3rd	Bill Dorosz<BR>         2nd	Robert Dabrowski<BR>         1st	Phil Randolph<P>Best T-top Fiero<BR>   <BR>         3rd	Dana Junkins<BR>         2nd	Tim Perrigo<BR>         1st	Cliff Knight<BR>Most miles driven to the show in a Fiero<BR>Larry Wheeler<P>Presidents choice award<BR>Bill Dorosz<P>Best Engine Conversion<BR>Joe Becker<P><BR>Best display of paint / decals<BR>Tim Perrigo<P>Best Fiero that was reconstructed<BR>Chris Schafer<P>Best 100% all original<BR>Tim Perrigo<P>Best of show<BR>Tim Perrigo		<P><BR>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.focone.org" TARGET=_blank>www.focone.org</A><p>[This message has been edited by FOCONE (edited 06-18-2001).]||||reg||14
